cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data, please cite the dataset you used (each folder has its own CITATION.cff and DOI), or cite the collection as below."
title: "Legal marketing open data (US)"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Probative Growth"
    website: "https://probativegrowth.com/"
abstract: "Open, citable datasets on US law-firm marketing: lawyer advertising rules for all 50 states and DC, bar ad filing and fees, ethics opinions, ad-platform policies, attorney fee caps, federal MDL dockets, Spanish-language demand, California court filings by county and Probative benchmarks. Every record quotes its primary source and the date it was checked. Not legal advice."
keywords:
  - "legal marketing"
  - "lawyer advertising"
  - "attorney advertising"
  - "legal data"
  - "open data"
  - "mcp-server"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://probativegrowth.com/data/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ops864/legal-marketing-data"
date-released: "2026-10-29"
version: "2026-10-29"
